  subtitles:
  - line: "Multicellular animal life!  I can\u2019t believe it!"
    seconds: 4.865
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Any astrobiologist would kill to be the first to find it, and I have!
    seconds: 10.797
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Regardless, that quadrupedal species is obviously carnivorous.
    seconds: 19.984
    isFromRadio: 0
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Even if it\u2019s unfamiliar with humans, I should keep my distance."
    seconds: 23.894
